message: "If you use this software in your research or academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "nanoCRISPER 3D with Integrated Immunoshield DRA: Interactive 3D Lipid Nanoparticle Biophysics & Codon-Aware CRISPR Base Editing Suite"
abstract: "A computational nanomedicine and molecular visualization platform for modeling mRNA/sgRNA base editor lipid nanoparticles (LNPs). Features Fibonacci sphere lattice cross-sections, de Gennes polymer corona scaling, ApoE opsonin kinetics, Henderson-Hasselbalch ionization kinetics, and dual-strand codon-aware base editing with South Asian genomic variant collision detection."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-19"
